{
  "id": "MRK.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mar 3",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omusaija ow'omukono gukabire",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu akagaruka yataaha omu isorrokaniro; yasangamu omusaija ow'akaba akabire omukono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamuhanga amaiso, barole obu araaba naija kumukiza ha Sabbato, nukwo bamunyegerre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagambira omusaija ow'akaba akabire omukono ati: “Ija hanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo yabakagwize ati: “Nikiikirizibwa Ebiragiro bya Musa kukora ekirungi ha Sabbato rundi ekibi? Okujuna obwomeezi rundi kubwita?” Baitu bbo baaculeera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yababungyamu amaiso aina ekiniga, asaalirwe habw'okutahwituka kw'emitima yabu, nukwo kugambira omusaija ati: “Gorra omukono gwawe.” Yagugorra, omukono gwe gwakira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafalisaayo baaturuka aheeru, baatandika ahonaaho kuhanuura n'ab'ekitebe kya Herode nkooku baraamwita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu naakiza baingi ha musa gw'enyanja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yarugayo n'abeegesebwa be, yagenda ha musa gw'enyanja; kandi ekitebe ky'abantu baingi abaarugire Galiraaya baamukuraatira. Abandi baingi abaarugire Buyudaaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerusaalemu, na Idumaaya, n'abaarugire nseeri ya Yorudaani, n'ab'omu bicweka ebiherraine Tiiro na Sidooni obu baahulire byona ebi yakozire, baija nambere ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.5.1+LUK.5.2+LUK.5.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 5:1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaragira abeegesebwa be kumutungira obwato habw'abantu kuba baingi, nukwo baleke kumufunza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe akaba akirize baingi nukwo boona abakaba barwaire kusindikangana, bamukwateho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abakaba baina emyoyo emibi obu baamurozire, baagwa omu maiso ge, nibaamuza bati: “Iwe oli Mwana wa Ruhanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu uwe akabateererra muno okutamurangaaniza omu bantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu naakoma abakwenda ikumi na babiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatemba omu nsozi, yayeta abo aba yagondeze kumuhondera. Bbo baija nambere ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakomamu ikumi na babiri kwikara nawe, kandi abatumege okurangirra Amakuru Amarungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabaha obusobozi obw'okubinga emyoyo emibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubo banu: Simooni ou yarukire Petero; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo mutabani wa Zebedaayo na Yohaana owanyina aba yarukire ibara Boanerege, amakuru gaalyo ngu: bantu ababiihirwa bwango; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andereya na Filipo, Batolomayo na Matayo, Tomasi na Yakobbo mutabani wa Alifaayo, Tadeo na Simooni omurwanirizi w'ihanga lye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yuda Isikalyota ayamugobiize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu na mukuru w'emyoyo mibi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yataaha omu ka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe ky'abantu kyagaruka kyayesorooza, nahabweki Yesu n'abeegesebwa be batasobole kulya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abe'ka y'owaabu obu baakihuliire, baaturuka kumwiha omu kitebe habw'okuhurra abamu nibagamba bati: “Ahunguutukire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 9:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeegesa b'ebiragiro abaarugire Yerusaalemu bakagamba bati: “Ataahirwemu Beelizebuli, mukuru w'emyoyo emibi, kandi habw'obusobozi bwe nikyo arukugibingira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Yesu yabeeta, yabeegesa omu nfumo ati: “Sitaani asobora ata kubinga Sitaani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuba obukama bwebaganizaamu bwonka, tibusobora kwikaraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuba n'eka eyebaganiizaamu yonka, nayo tesobora kwikaraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sitaani obu araaba ayebaganizemu kwerwanisa wenka, tasobora kwikaraho, ahwerekerra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningira tiharoho muntu asobora kutaaha enju y'omusaija ow'amaani akanyaga ebintu bye, rundi buli abandize kumuboha, nukwo anyage eby'omu njuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mazimakwo nimbagambira nti: Abantu baliganyirwa ebibi byabo byona, n'ebijumo byona ebi bajuma Ruhanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 12:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu weena anyakujuma Mwoyo Ahikiriire taliganyirwa, ekibi kye kirimusingisa omusango ebiro byona” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekyamugambisize eki nukwo bbo kugira ngu: “Aina omwoyo omubi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyina Yesu na bagenzi be",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyina Yesu na bagenzi be bakaija, baayemerra aheeru baamutumaho nibamweta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe ky'abantu kikaba kiikaliire kimwehinguliriize; abatumirwe nukwo kumugambira bati: “Nyoko na bagenzi baawe bali aheeru nibakweta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe yabagarukamu ati: “Mau nuwe oha, na bagenzi bange nubo baha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabungyamu amaiso abo abakaba bamwehinguliriize, yagamba ati: “Mau na bagenzi bange nubo banu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weena anyakukora Ruhanga eki agonza, nuwe mugenzi wange, nuwe munyaanya nyowe, kandi nuwe mau.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
